{"id":"llvm-otool-13.1","n":"llvm-otool-13","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"llvm-13","ver":"1:13.0.1-2ubuntu2.2","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/l/llvm-toolchain-13/llvm-13_13.0.1-2ubuntu2.2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/llvm-otool-13.1.gz","sha256":"eaa88c10d1db64553c4168816ac58c952988e7b07b21daff225c35c0a935cb95","date":"2023-07-14","origin":"13"}},"nopt":{"u":25},"desc":"Mach-O dumping tool","u":[["NAME","<p>llvm-otool - Mach-O dumping tool</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>llvm-otool</b> [<i>option…</i>] <i>[file…]</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>llvm-otool</b> is a tool for dumping Mach-O files.</p> <p>It attempts to be command-line-compatible and output-compatible with macOS’s <b>otool</b>.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-arch &lt;value&gt;</b></dt><dd>Select slice of universal Mach-O file.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-C</b></dt><dd>Print linker optimization hints.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-D</b></dt><dd>Print shared library id.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-d</b></dt><dd>Print data section.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-f</b></dt><dd>Print universal headers.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-G</b></dt><dd>Print data-in-code table.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--help-hidden</b></dt><dd>Print help for hidden flags.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--help</b></dt><dd>Print help.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h</b></dt><dd>Print mach header.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-I</b></dt><dd>Print indirect symbol table.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-j</b></dt><dd>Print opcode bytes.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-L</b></dt><dd>Print used shared libraries.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-l</b></dt><dd>Print load commnads.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-mcpu=&lt;value&gt;</b></dt><dd>Select cpu for disassembly.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-o</b></dt><dd>Print Objective-C segment.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-P</b></dt><dd>Print __TEXT,__info_plist section as strings.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-p &lt;function name&gt;</b></dt><dd>Start disassembly at &lt;function name&gt;.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-r</b></dt><dd>Print relocation entries.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-s &lt;segname&gt; &lt;sectname&gt;</b></dt><dd>Print contents of section.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-t</b></dt><dd>Print text section.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--version</b></dt><dd>Print version.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-V</b></dt><dd>Symbolize disassembled operands (implies <i>-v</i>).</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-v</b></dt><dd>Verbose output / disassemble when printing text sections.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-X</b></dt><dd>Omit leading addresses or headers.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-x</b></dt><dd>Print all text sections.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt><b>@&lt;FILE&gt;</b></dt><dd>Read command-line options and commands from response file <i>&lt;FILE&gt;</i>.</dd></dl> </div> <br>"],["EXIT STATUS","<p><b>llvm-otool</b> exits with a non-zero exit code if there is an error. Otherwise, it exits with code 0.</p>"],["BUGS","<p>To report bugs, please visit &lt;<i>https://bugs.llvm.org/</i>&gt;.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>llvm-nm(1)</b>, <b>llvm-objdump(1)</b></p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Maintained by the LLVM Team (https://llvm.org/).</p>"],["COPYRIGHT","<p>2003-2023, LLVM Project</p>"]]}